🔹 Shell Script — Menu for System Checks
bash
#!/bin/bash

echo "Choose an option:"
echo "1) IP"
echo "2) Disk"
echo "3) Memory"
read choice

case $choice in
  1) hostname -I ;;
  2) df -h ;;
  3) free -h ;;
  *) echo "Invalid choice" ;;
esac
Jenkins Pipeline — Automate All Tasks
I am replicating how to automate all tasks in a Jenkins Pipeline under real-world stages.

groovy
pipeline {
    agent any
    environment {
        INSTITUTE_NAME = "Prasanta Pathnex"
        TEAM = "DevOps"
        ENV = "prod"
        PROJECT = "Prasanta-Pathnex-Training"
    }
    stages {
        stage('Infrastructure') {
            steps {
                sh 'terraform apply -auto-approve'
            }
        }
        stage('App Deployment') {
            steps {
                sh 'ansible-playbook user.yml'
                sh 'kubectl apply -f k8s-deployment.yml'
            }
        }
        stage('Monitoring Checks') {
            steps {
                sh './menu-checks.sh'
            }
        }
    }
}
GitLab CI — Realistic Pipeline
I am replicating how to combine all tasks in a GitLab CI pipeline.

yaml
stages:
  - infrastructure
  - app_deployment
  - monitoring_checks

variables:
  INSTITUTE_NAME: "Prasanta Pathnex"
  TEAM: "DevOps"
  ENV: "prod"
  PROJECT: "Prasanta-Pathnex-Training"

infrastructure:
  stage: infrastructure
  image: hashicorp/terraform:latest
  script:
    - terraform init
    - terraform apply -auto-approve

app_deployment:
  stage: app_deployment
  image: alpine:latest
  script:
    - ansible-playbook user.yml
    - kubectl apply -f k8s-deployment.yml

monitoring_checks:
  stage: monitoring_checks
  image: alpine:latest
  script:
    - ./menu-checks.sh
